	(text "J2: harness to the pack sense board 2x10, same pin map.\nColumns 4-10 zigzag B0..B13: a bent pin shorts 1 cell\nacross a column, 2 cells along a row.\nPin 3: NTC and presence return, to VSS here, no cell connection.\nPin 4: B0 Kelvin tap, no bond to BAT- (R below). Spare: pin 12."
