	)
	(text "Four thermistors: TS1, TS3, CFETOFF (NTC1-3), HDQ (board).\nTS2 stays free as SHUTDOWN wake (p22 pin table, section 13):\nswitch to VSS through 10k (Fig 16-2 R27). 1nF: p65 limit <4nF.\nREGIN, BREG tied to VSS, REG1, REG2 open (p75): I2C pull-ups on LP.\nCFETOFF as NTC needs DFETOFF set as BOTHOFF to stop CHG by pin (p48)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 256.54 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "192bffae-0e96-575e-af78-41734bde789b")
	)
	(text "SIZING (shunt 0.3 mOhm: no 0.25 mOhm 4-terminal part exists; datasheet p22 steps)\nOCD1 24 mV = 80 A, 66.7-93.3 A at +/-4 mV, delay 100 ms    OCD3 60 A for 1 s (current-based, inside the AFE, the agreed 60 A ceiling)\nOCC 12 mV = 40 A, 33.3-48.8 A at -2/+2.65 mV, under the 50 A limit    SCD 60 mV = 200 A, 170-230 A, delay 30 us: bank A short protection (105-165 A, about 10 us) acts first\nOCD and OCC are set in 2 mV steps. V(OC_ACC) is -2/+2.65 mV below 20 mV, +/-4 mV 20-56 mV, +/-5 mV 56-100 mV. RS1 takes 6.75 W at 150 A: 5 W part, 100 ms path only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 215.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4b72bfee-7a72-5ee4-b9e9-80818f6ab016")
	)
	(text "OPEN ON THIS SHEET\n1. Balance FETs are captured below (SLUAA81 Fig 2-2). OTP/data memory owed: Cell Balance Min Cell V 3900 mV, Max Cells 4.\n2. CP1 raised to 1 uF for the 4+4 FET gate load (p65 rule): worst case 1.69 uC droops 11 V by 1.7 V, pump start about 130 ms.\n3. OTP owed: DFETOFF Pin Config 0x42 (active high, BOTHOFF), CFETOFF and HDQ as thermistor inputs. Presence and DFETOFF logic are on HP_power_board.\n   Cell 1 Interconnect stays 0: VC0 reads the Kelvin B0 tab. VC0 sits below VSS by the return drop, 60 mV at 60 A at the 1 mOhm limit (abs max VSS - 0.3 V).\n4. RS1 land: CSS4J-4026 on the BVR4026 library footprint, check against the Bourns drawing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 233.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "047c5a2f-b028-523c-9927-0f334d6c49b3")
	)
