	(text "Keeps VC0 defined with the harness out. 9 uA at 60 A.\nC23 1 uF to VSS, C13 100 nF (TI range 0.1 to 1 uF, 100R at its maximum) and D15\nhold VC0 through a short: 525 A, 3 mOhm per cell, FET off at 83 us, return 1.0 mOhm.\n-0.23 V at 25 C, -0.28 V at 0 C, -0.34 V at -40 C (limit -0.3 V).\nKeep the return at 1 mOhm or less, measured. UTD at -10 C: see log."
